//     package's parser gives it, and otherwise accepted. Accepted fields are
//     decoded by offset; Wormhole's Go SDK decodes the same transfer headers
//     and serializes the same governance payloads;
//   - testPayloads named sdk/...: UpgradeContract payloads, which no corpus
//     step reaches, serialized here by the SDK.

